---
description: Shared project requirements for Coffee Bean Explorer
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `.github/copilot-instructions.md`.

- Inspect the current stack and actual `originsg.json` before implementation.
- Map location selection opens the associated coffee-bean detail modal and increments score once.
- A configured threshold triggers a loading transition exactly once.
- Loading variant follows the active `light` or `dark` theme.
- The coffee-bean bag transitions into the cart.
- Preserve data, accessibility, keyboard dialog behavior, and reduced-motion support.
- Do not invent schema or coffee facts; run available checks and report actual results.

- Frontend must use React JavaScript JSX (`.jsx`), not TypeScript/TSX.
- Add a Stripe test-mode demo checkout using Stripe Checkout or Elements/Payment Element.
- Keep secret keys server-side, validate prices server-side, and handle success/failure/cancel/retry safely.
- Never mark an order paid based only on client-side state or a redirect.
